stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> RECEIVING: Start attempt
    CREATED --> RETRYABLE: Initiation lease expires
    RECEIVING --> VERIFYING: Exact byte count
    VERIFYING --> COMPLETE: Durable blob then metadata commit
    RECEIVING --> RETRYABLE: Confirmed failure or lease expiry
    VERIFYING --> RETRYABLE: Confirmed failure or lease expiry
    RETRYABLE --> RECEIVING: Recheck quota and acquire fenced attempt
    RETRYABLE --> EXPIRED: 24 hours inactive
    COMPLETE --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
